#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:5
#: d860b8f57971469fa9b2f201f99e2645
msgid "Connecting with GCS"
msgstr "与地面站连接"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:7
#: c91c8c97deac42f9884fc025870e7edb
msgid ""
"This article explains the different mechanisms for connecting the Antenna "
"Tracker to a GCS (or even multiple GCSs at the same time)."
msgstr "本文介绍将天线跟踪器与一个（甚至多个）地面站连接起来的几种方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:11
#: fb7e30e6f8244b99a5b17a07583baa37
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:13
#: 45e3976693cb4e1bbf79051f58de3422
msgid ""
"There are a number ways that the Antenna Tracker's connection with the "
"vehicle can be made accessible to a GCS:"
msgstr "天线跟踪器与载具之间的连接可以通过多种方式开放给地面站使用："

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:16
#: ab0a2fc0b4d54bd69930c2fe5d90b8fe
msgid ""
"Connect a USB cable from the antenna tracker control board to the GCS "
"machine"
msgstr "用 USB 数据线把天线跟踪器控制板与地面站电脑相连"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:18
#: 9953577dac174f4ba58fd2840df0e129
msgid ""
"Connect a 2nd pair of radios between the antenna tracker control board and "
"the GCS machine"
msgstr "在天线跟踪器控制板与地面站电脑之间再增加一对数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:20
#: 4128fe790ed741ec9f768cc4ac75402e
msgid ""
"Connect one additional radio and use the experimental multi-point SiK radio "
"software"
msgstr "只增加一个额外电台，并使用实验性的多点 SiK 电台固件"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:22
#: 01f18d805fc749c4b3f9384063216e83
msgid ""
"Connect a :ref:`companion computer <dev:companion-computers>` and set-up a "
"WiFi access point"
msgstr "接入 :ref:`伴飞计算机 <dev:companion-computers>` 并搭建 WiFi 接入点"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:29
#: 9d1b5fd76e9b42f5b692dba29e243f3c
msgid "Connect with a USB cable"
msgstr "通过 USB 数据线连接"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:34
#: fe47bd39db52498aac67a3ff5f222347
msgid ""
"You can simply connect your ground station computer to the autopilot using a"
" long micro USB cable."
msgstr "可以简单地用一根长的 micro USB 线把地面站电脑接到飞控上。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:38
#: 099e974e54774e60884410df8de8fc3e
msgid "Connect a 2nd pair of radios"
msgstr "再增加一对数传电台"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:43
#: 148cb6bbc7334484acc405bf8e22c459
msgid ""
"A second pair of radios (or even a :ref:`bluetooth data link <copter:common-"
"mission-planner-bluetooth-connectivity>`) can be used to connect the Antenna"
" Tracker controller to the PC running the ground station."
msgstr ""
"可以使用第二对数传电台（或一对 :ref:`蓝牙数据链 <copter:common-mission-planner-bluetooth-"
"connectivity>`）把天线跟踪器控制板与运行地面站的 PC 连起来。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:47
#: eb9d27c9921e4ce7ab4445c586a78be6
msgid ""
"If using a :ref:`SIK radio <copter:common-sik-telemetry-radio>` the Net IDs "
"of the radios connecting the Antenna Tracker to the PC should be different "
"than the Net IDs for the radio connecting the vehicle to the Antenna "
"Tracker. Net IDs can be changed by :ref:`configuring <common-configuring-a-"
"telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner>` them in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 :ref:`SIK 电台 <copter:common-sik-telemetry-radio>`，则用于「跟踪器—PC」的电台 Net ID"
" 应当与「载具—跟踪器」的电台 Net ID 不同。Net ID 可在 Mission Planner 中 :ref:`配置 <common-"
"configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:53
#: c6022274e60e40f79e1c754e91447644
msgid "Connect one more radio and use multi-point SiK radio software"
msgstr "增加一个电台并使用多点 SiK 电台固件"

#: ../../source/docs/connecting-with-gcs.rst:56
#: 89e3df44ec5341c8b0afe4b273074e31
msgid "Connect a companion computer and set-up a wifi access point"
msgstr "接入伴飞计算机并搭建 WiFi 接入点"
